// =============================================================================
// Chora Tenancy Service (gRPC)
// =============================================================================
//
// Source-of-truth: docs/architecture-review-inputs-2026-05-07.md Tier 1 D1
//   + chora-contracts/openapi/tenancy-admin.yaml
//   + memory project_chora_topology.md
//
// Inter-service gRPC contract for the Tenancy + Billing supporting domain
// (chora_tenancy database, Team 3 / Platform). Tenancy and Billing are
// COMBINED into a single domain — there is no separate billing service.
//
// REST surface in chora-contracts/openapi/tenancy-admin.yaml is the H+
// admin equivalent; gRPC is for internal service-to-service sync calls
// (mTLS via Cloud Service Mesh per CLAUDE.md §4 protocol strategy).
//
// Aggregates exposed:
//   - Tenant         — top-level tenant record + hosting mode
//   - Member         — TenantMembership (GCID -> Tenant association)
//   - AddOn          — composable feature-flag plan (NOT tier pricing)
//   - Invoice        — Stripe-backed invoice + line items
//
// Composable Add-On Plans, NOT tier pricing — per Project Identity in
// CLAUDE.md. DigitalSkin is NEVER referenced here (earned, not purchased
// — see chora.sharing.* events).
//
// CreateSubTenant supports white-label / franchise hierarchies (parent_tenant_id).
//
// Deployed in chora-489812 team-platform pool. mTLS via Cloud Service Mesh;
// SPIFFE identity in mesh; W3C trace context in gRPC metadata.
// =============================================================================

